      "normalizedSource": "If the sphere’s [`isGeodesic`](scnsphere/isgeodesic.md) property is [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), SceneKit creates the sphere’s surface by successively subdividing the faces of an icosahedron (or twenty-sided polyhedron).",
